 margins and much more</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>1997</year><volume>79</volume><fpage>1453</fpage><lpage>1458</lpage><comment>discussion 1459&#x02013;1460.</comment><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/(SICI)1097-0142(19970415)79:8&#x0003c;1453::AID-CNCR1&#x0003e;3.0.CO;2-C</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9118023</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Carter</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><article-title>Margins of "lumpectomy" for breast cancer</article-title><source>Hum Pathol</source><year>1986</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>330</fpage><lpage>332</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0046-8177(86)80455-5</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3957334</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Gould</surname><given-names>EW</given-names></name><name><surname>Robinson</surname><given-names>PG</given-names></name><article-title>The pathologist's examination of the "lumpectomy" &#x02013; the pathologists' view of surgical margins</article-title><source>Semin Surg Oncol</source><year>1992</year><volume>8</volume><fpage>129</fpage><lpage>135</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1496222</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Veronesi</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><article-title>How important is the assessment of resection margins in conservative surgery for breast cancer?</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>1994</year><volume>74</volume><fpage>1660</fpage><lpage>1661</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/1097-0142(19940915)74:6&#x0003c;1660::AID-CNCR2820740603&#x0003e;3.0.CO;2-T</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8082066</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Klimberg</surname><given-names>VS</given-names></name><name><surname>Harms</surname><given-names>S</given-names></